# Build Jenkins Image

Build the custom Jenkins image:

```bash
docker build -t jenkins:v1 .
```

# Run Jenkins Container

Start the Jenkins container and configure the admin user using environment variables:

```bash
docker run -d \
  --name jenkins \
  -p 8080:8080 \
  -p 50000:50000 \
  -e JENKINS_ADMIN_ID=admin \
  -e JENKINS_ADMIN_PASSWORD='StrongPassword123!' \
  -e PROXMOX_PASSWORD='YourProxmoxPassword' \
  -e CODEK9_USERNAME='codek9' \
  -e CODEK9_PASSWORD='YourCodeK9Password' \
  jenkins:v1
```

# Verify Jenkins

Open your browser and navigate to:

```text
http://SERVER_IP:8080
```

